{"name": "test_test_db_is_same_file_service_writes", "status": "passed", "description": "前置自检：测试读的数据库文件，必须和服务写的是同一个。\n\n为什么必须有这条：\n    如果 DEMO_DB 指错了文件，后面所有一致性用例都会失败，\n    但真正的原因只是\"路径配错\"，而不是被测系统有缺陷 ——\n    这属于典型的\"环境问题伪装成缺陷\"。\n    这条用例用一个探针任务把两者区分开，并直接告诉你排查方向。\n", "start": 1790521938022, "stop": 1790521938031, "uuid": "478b6781-32bb-48c9-8ea8-efdcc606fd7d", "historyId": "5fca0588c5ff6b0f472a72e194d9a905", "testCaseId": "5fca0588c5ff6b0f472a72e194d9a905", "fullName": "test_db_consistency#test_test_db_is_same_file_service_writes", "labels": [{"name": "suite", "value": "test_db_consistency"}, {"name": "host", "value": "LAPTOP-8KAIDUIT"}, {"name": "thread", "value": "39276-MainThread"}, {"name": "framework", "value": "pytest"}, {"name": "language", "value": "cpython3"}, {"name": "package", "value": "test_db_consistency"}], "titlePath": ["test_db_consistency.py"]}